O4GF33jcEEYZtJNLROw3LA26YN20o1ceIBD9eRA&oe=6B032F0A"}, {"file_name": "umbrella.png", "id": "268884725149329", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001663_268884728482662_9148176858968514575_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SvW_X9FyRAgQ7kNvwE-q3dW&_nc_oc=Adoa3tPZHPxABJDNU61ifc-PiuS6KTutre_C_APx-CRj8_q6eePHuhRuC05wLZvpG4M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR_qFk8ZsXxwOzDwNhkdSS-KbvBJCC3Ym9FqAwuPfdSPw&oe=6B03110B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Znanyeland - VR ", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Znanyeland is a virtual theme park, to provide a safe and cost-free theme park experience.\nImmerse yourself in a virtual game and discover a world of limitless possibilities brimming with fun and excitement. \nEnjoy the thrills and enchantment of a theme park from the comfort of your own home. \nFrom the joys of a rollercoaster ride to levitating water slides, Znanyeland is the safest way to relish the excitement of a theme park. \nThere is something for everyone! Get nostalgic and savour the thrill of it all. hop on and take a ride!", "short_description": "In these ever-changing times, we believe that everyone should be able to enjoy a theme park experience without having to leave their homes. \nZnanyeland is a specially designed virtual theme park, tailored to accomplish just that. Our goal is to design this carnival with a safe environment to enjoy a theme park experience at the comfort of their own homes.\n It's also entirely free!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.znanye.com/#", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pastelcube Technologies Private Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.znanye.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APP